{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\nSHRINK_FACTOR: float = 1.3\ndef comb_sort(data: List[Union[int, float]]) -> List[Union[int, float]]:\n    \"\"\"Sorts the given list of numbers in ascending order using the Comb Sort algorithm.\"\"\"\n    n = len(data)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return data\n\n    gap = n\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        if gap > 1:\n            gap = int(gap / SHRINK_FACTOR)\n            if gap < 1:\n                gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        i = 0\n        while i + gap < n:\n            if data[i] > data[i + gap]:\n                data[i], data[i + gap] = data[i + gap], data[i]\n                swapped = True\n            i += 1\n    return data"}
