{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "def is_Diff(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a number is divisible by 11 using the alternating sum of digits rule.\n    Handles negative numbers by taking their absolute value for processing.\n    \"\"\"\n    abs_number = abs(number)\n    s_number = str(abs_number)\n    \n    alternating_sum = 0\n    for i, digit_char in enumerate(s_number):\n        digit = int(digit_char)\n        if (len(s_number) - 1 - i) % 2 == 0:\n            alternating_sum += digit\n        else:\n            alternating_sum -= digit\n    \n    return alternating_sum % 11 == 0"}
