{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "def eulerian_num(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the Eulerian number A(n, m) using a recursive approach with memoization.\"\"\"\n    # Initialize memoization cache if it doesn't exist.\n    if not hasattr(eulerian_num, 'cache'):\n        eulerian_num.cache = {}\n\n    # Check cache for previously computed values.\n    if (n, m) in eulerian_num.cache:\n        return eulerian_num.cache[(n, m)]\n\n    # Base cases for Eulerian numbers.\n    if n == 0 and m == 0:\n        result = 1\n    elif m < 0 or m >= n:\n        result = 0\n    else:\n        # Apply the recurrence relation: A(n, m) = (m+1)A(n-1, m) + (n-m)A(n-1, m-1).\n        result = (m + 1) * eulerian_num(n - 1, m) + \\\n                 (n - m) * eulerian_num(n - 1, m - 1)\n    \n    # Store the computed result in the cache before returning.\n    eulerian_num.cache[(n, m)] = result\n    return result"}
