{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(numbers: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zeroes in an array of integers.\n    Handles empty arrays and arrays with no non-zero elements as specified.\"\"\"\n    if not numbers:\n        return 0.0\n\n    count_zeroes = 0\n    count_non_zeroes = 0\n\n    for num in numbers:\n        if num == 0:\n            count_zeroes += 1\n        else:\n            count_non_zeroes += 1\n\n    if count_non_zeroes == 0:\n        return float('inf')\n    \n    return float(count_zeroes) / count_non_zeroes"}
