{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(arr: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in a list of integers.\n    Returns 0.0 if there are no non-zero elements to avoid division by zero.\"\"\"\n    zero_count_val = 0\n    non_zero_count = 0\n\n    for item in arr:\n        if item == 0:\n            zero_count_val += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_count += 1\n\n    if non_zero_count == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    \n    return float(zero_count_val) / non_zero_count"}
