{"task_id": "Mbpp/160", "solution": "def extended_gcd(a: int, b: int) -> tuple[int, int, int]:\n    \"\"\"Implements the Extended Euclidean Algorithm to find g, x, y such that ax + by = g.\"\"\"\n    if a == 0:\n        return (b, 0, 1)\n    g, x, y = extended_gcd(b % a, a)\n    return (g, y - (b // a) * x, x)\ndef find_solution(a: int, b: int, n: int) -> tuple[int, int] | None:\n    \"\"\"Calculates one integer solution (x, y) for the equation ax + by = n.\"\"\"\n    if a == 0 and b == 0:\n        return (0, 0) if n == 0 else None\n\n    g, x0, y0 = extended_gcd(a, b)\n\n    if n % g != 0:\n        return None\n\n    k = n // g\n    x = x0 * k\n    y = y0 * k\n    return (x, y)"}
