{"task_id": "Mbpp/235", "solution": "def even_bit_set_number(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Sets all even-indexed bits (0, 2, 4, ...) of the given number to 1.\n    This function operates on the first 64 bits for mask generation.\"\"\"\n\n    MAX_BITS_TO_CONSIDER = 64\n\n    even_bits_mask = 0\n    # Generate a mask with all even bits set up to MAX_BITS_TO_CONSIDER.\n    for i in range(0, MAX_BITS_TO_CONSIDER, 2):\n        even_bits_mask |= (1 << i)\n\n    # Perform a bitwise OR operation to set the even bits.\n    return number | even_bits_mask"}
