{"task_id": "Mbpp/264", "solution": "def dog_age(human_age: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates a dog's age in dog years based on its age in human years.\n    Assumes human_age is a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if human_age == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif human_age == 1:\n        return 10  # First year counts as 10.5, rounded down for integer output.\n    elif human_age == 2:\n        return 21  # Second year adds another 10.5 (total 21).\n    else:\n        # Each subsequent year adds 4 dog years.\n        return 21 + (human_age - 2) * 4"}
