{"task_id": "Mbpp/264", "solution": "def dog_age(human_years: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates a dog's age in dog years based on specific conversion rules.\n    The result is truncated to an integer if the calculation yields a float.\n    \"\"\"\n    if human_years == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif human_years == 1:\n        return int(10.5)\n    elif human_years == 2:\n        return int(2 * 10.5)\n    else:  # human_years > 2\n        dog_years = 2 * 10.5 + (human_years - 2) * 4\n        return int(dog_years)"}
