{"task_id": "Mbpp/270", "solution": "def sum_even_and_even_index(numbers_list: list[int | float]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of even numbers found at even positions in a list.\n    It considers both integer and whole-number float values for evenness.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for index, number in enumerate(numbers_list):\n        if index % 2 == 0:  # Check if the current position (index) is even.\n            if isinstance(number, float) and number.is_integer():\n                # For floats that are whole numbers, check if their integer value is even.\n                if int(number) % 2 == 0:\n                    total_sum += int(number)\n            elif isinstance(number, int) and number % 2 == 0:\n                # For integers, check if the number itself is even.\n                total_sum += number\n    return total_sum"}
