{"task_id": "Mbpp/392", "solution": "_max_sum_memo_cache = {}\ndef get_max_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum sum for n using a recursive formula with memoization.\n    It follows f(n) = max((f(n/2) + f(n/3) + f(n/4) + f(n/5)), n) using integer division.\n    \"\"\"\n    global _max_sum_memo_cache\n\n    if n in _max_sum_memo_cache:\n        return _max_sum_memo_cache[n]\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    sum_of_parts = (\n        get_max_sum(n // 2) +\n        get_max_sum(n // 3) +\n        get_max_sum(n // 4) +\n        get_max_sum(n // 5)\n    )\n\n    result = max(sum_of_parts, n)\n    _max_sum_memo_cache[n] = result\n    return result"}
