{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first 'n' even natural numbers.\n\n    Args:\n        n: A positive integer representing the count of even numbers.\n\n    Returns:\n        The sum of the cubes of the first 'n' even natural numbers.\n\n    Raises:\n        ValueError: If 'n' is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise ValueError(\"Parameter 'n' must be an integer.\")\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Parameter 'n' must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_number = 2 * i\n        total_sum += even_number ** 3\n    return total_sum"}
