{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    Returns 0.0 if n is less than or equal to 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0.0\n\n    sum_of_cubes = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_of_cubes += i ** 3\n\n    return float(sum_of_cubes) / n"}
