{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers up to a given index n using memoization.\"\"\"\n    memo = {\n        0: 3,\n        1: 0,\n        2: 2\n    }\n\n    def _get_perrin(k: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Helper to calculate the kth Perrin number with memoization.\"\"\"\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n        \n        result = _get_perrin(k - 2) + _get_perrin(k - 3)\n        memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += _get_perrin(i)\n    return total_sum"}
