{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n):\n    # Perrin number memoization cache for this call.\n    memo = {\n        0: 3,\n        1: 0,\n        2: 2\n    }\n\n    def _calculate_perrin_number(k):\n        # Calculates the Kth Perrin number using memoization.\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n\n        result = _calculate_perrin_number(k - 2) + _calculate_perrin_number(k - 3)\n        memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    # Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers up to N (inclusive).\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += _calculate_perrin_number(i)\n    return total_sum"}
