{"task_id": "Mbpp/471", "solution": "def find_remainder(arr: list[int], n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the product of all elements in the input list `arr` modulo `n`.\n    Applies the modulo operation at each step to prevent intermediate overflows.\n    \"\"\"\n    product = 1\n    for x in arr:\n        product = (product * x) % n\n    return product"}
