{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "import math\ndef wind_chill(velocity: float, temperature: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the wind chill index based on temperature in Celsius and wind velocity in km/h.\n    The result is rounded up to the next highest integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Wind Chill Index formula (standard for Celsius and km/h)\n    # WCI = 13.12 + 0.6215*T - 11.37*V^0.16 + 0.3965*T*V^0.16\n    wci = (\n        13.12\n        + (0.6215 * temperature)\n        - (11.37 * math.pow(velocity, 0.16))\n        + (0.3965 * temperature * math.pow(velocity, 0.16))\n    )\n    return math.ceil(wci)"}
