{"task_id": "Mbpp/726", "solution": "def multiply_elements(input_tuple: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Multiplies adjacent elements in a tuple of numbers.\n    Returns a new tuple where each element is the product of t_i * t_{i+1}.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for i in range(len(input_tuple) - 1):\n        result.append(input_tuple[i] * input_tuple[i+1])\n    return tuple(result)"}
