{"task_id": "Mbpp/730", "solution": "def consecutive_duplicates(input_list):\n    \"\"\"Removes consecutive duplicate elements from a list.\n    Returns a new list with the order of non-duplicate elements preserved.\"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    result = [input_list[0]]\n    for i in range(1, len(input_list)):\n        if input_list[i] != input_list[i-1]:\n            result.append(input_list[i])\n    return result"}
