{"task_id": "Mbpp/742", "solution": "import math\ndef area_tetrahedron(side_length: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the total surface area of a regular tetrahedron.\n    It takes `side_length` as a float and returns the surface area as a float.\n    \"\"\"\n    if side_length <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Side length must be a positive number.\")\n    return math.sqrt(3) * (side_length ** 2)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/742", "solution": "SQRT_3 = 1.73205080756887729353\ndef area_tetrahedron(side_length: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the total surface area of a regular tetrahedron.\n    The side_length must be a positive floating-point number.\n    \"\"\"\n    return SQRT_3 * (side_length ** 2)"}
