{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(input_list: list, n: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Rotates a list to the right by n positions, returning a new list.\n    Handles negative n, n greater than list length, and empty lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    list_length = len(input_list)\n    effective_n = n % list_length\n\n    return input_list[-effective_n:] + input_list[:-effective_n]"}
