{"task_id": "Mbpp/751", "solution": "from typing import List\ndef check_min_heap(arr: List) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the array satisfies the min-heap property.\n    Iterates through parent nodes and compares them with their children.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    # Iterate up to the last possible parent node.\n    for i in range(n // 2):\n        left_child_idx = 2 * i + 1\n        right_child_idx = 2 * i + 2\n\n        # Compare parent with its left child.\n        if left_child_idx < n and arr[i] > arr[left_child_idx]:\n            return False\n\n        # Compare parent with its right child.\n        if right_child_idx < n and arr[i] > arr[right_child_idx]:\n            return False\n    return True"}
