{"task_id": "Mbpp/770", "solution": "def odd_num_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the fourth power of the first 'n' odd natural numbers.\n    It iterates from 1 to 'n', finding each odd number and adding its fourth power to a running total.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        odd_number = 2 * i - 1\n        total_sum += odd_number ** 4\n    return total_sum"}
