{"task_id": "Mbpp/771", "solution": "_OPENING_DELIMITERS = \"([{\"\n_DELIMITER_MAP = {\n    \"(\": \")\",\n    \"[\": \"]\",\n    \"{\": \"}\",\n}\n_CLOSING_DELIMITERS = set(_DELIMITER_MAP.values())\ndef check_expression(expression: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given string expression has balanced parentheses, brackets, and braces.\n    Assumes the input 'expression' is a string as per critical requirements.\n    \"\"\"\n    stack = []\n    \n    for char in expression:\n        if char in _OPENING_DELIMITERS:\n            stack.append(char)\n        elif char in _CLOSING_DELIMITERS:\n            if not stack:\n                return False  # Unmatched closing delimiter\n            \n            last_opening = stack.pop()\n            if _DELIMITER_MAP.get(last_opening) != char:\n                return False  # Mismatched delimiters\n            \n    return not stack  # True if stack is empty, False otherwise"}
