{"task_id": "Mbpp/771", "solution": "OPENING_BRACKETS = \"({[\"\nCLOSING_BRACKETS = \")}]\"\nBRACKET_MAP = {\")\": \"(\", \"}\": \"{\", \"]\": \"[\"}\ndef check_expression(expression: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given expression has balanced brackets.\n    Non-bracket characters are ignored.\"\"\"\n    stack = []\n    for char in expression:\n        if char in OPENING_BRACKETS:\n            stack.append(char)\n        elif char in CLOSING_BRACKETS:\n            if not stack:\n                return False\n            top_of_stack = stack.pop()\n            if BRACKET_MAP[char] != top_of_stack:\n                return False\n    return not stack"}
