{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "from typing import List, TypeVar, Union\nComparable = TypeVar('Comparable', bound=Union[int, float, str])\ndef right_insertion(data_list: List[Comparable], value: Comparable) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Locates the right insertion point for a specified value in a sorted list.\n    This function returns an insertion point which comes after (to the right of)\n    any existing entries of value in data_list.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(data_list)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if value < data_list[mid]:\n            high = mid\n        else:\n            low = mid + 1\n    return low"}
