{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(arr: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the index of the first occurrence of an element in a sorted array.\n    Returns the index of the first occurrence of target, or -1 if not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    low, high = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            high = mid - 1  # Try to find an earlier occurrence\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # arr[mid] > target\n            high = mid - 1\n    return result"}
