{"task_id": "Mbpp/805", "solution": "def max_sum_list(list_of_lists: list[list[int | float]]) -> list[int | float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Identifies the inner list with the highest sum of elements.\n    If multiple lists have the same maximum sum, the first one encountered is returned.\n    \"\"\"\n    return max(list_of_lists, key=sum)"}
